— 🇾🇪/🇸🇦 BREAKING: Yemen’s Armed Forces say they carried out two large-scale attacks using ballistic and cruise missiles and drones against sensitive targets in Riyadh and Aramco facilities in Yanbu.

According to the statement, both operations were successful and caused major fires at the targeted sites. The group said the attacks were carried out in response to continued Saudi airstrikes and vowed to continue what it described as “blockade for blockade and escalation for escalation” until Saudi military operations and restrictions on Yemen end.

